最后，你可以穿戴个人防护装备，

143
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:25,100
or popularly known as PPE.
也就是通常所说的 PPE。

144
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:28,100
So when we are talking about engineering controls,
说到工程控制，

145
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:31,100
