就必须有某种让激光器自动关闭的机制。

162
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:26,100
So we are talking about a lot of hardware
所以我们说的是大量的硬件，

163
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:33,100
that would be used to reduce any kind of risk of laser safety,
用来降低激光器运行期间任何激光安全风险、

164
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:38,100
of laser injury during the operation of the laser.
任何激光伤害的风险。

165
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:41,100
Not only are we talking about monitoring systems,
我们说的不仅是监控系统，

166
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:44,100
we're also talking about certain features,
还包括某些设施，

167
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:46,100
such as certain walls, beam shutters.
比如某些墙壁、光束快门。

168
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:48,100
You know, you may have a beam dumps
你知道，你可能会有光束收集器，

169
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:51,100
that would be collecting the laser radiation.
用来收集激光辐射。

170
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:52,100
You may have a beam attenuators
你可能会有光束衰减器，

171
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:54,100
that would be reducing the amount of power
用来降低

172
