由人员穿戴的装备，

198
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:20,100
such as laser technicians, laser safety officers,
比如激光技术人员、激光安全官，

199
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:25,100
and other people who will be present in a laser lab.
以及会在激光实验室中出现的其他人员。

200
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:27,100
So we're talking about protective eyewear,
我们说的是防护眼镜，

201
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:29,100
we're talking about gloves,
说的是手套，

202
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:31,100
we're talking about special clothing,
说的是特殊服装，

203
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:34,100
so anything that can go on an operator
所以任何可以穿戴在操作人员身上，

204
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:38,100
or on a human being that is present in a laser lab
或者穿戴在激光实验室里的人身上的东西，

205
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:40,100
is what's going to go
都属于

