There is also a risk to the skin injury.
还存在皮肤损伤的风险。

245
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:23,100
An important concept that has to be introduced
说到激光安全，

246
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:25,100
when it is about laser safety
必须引入一个重要的概念，

247
00:15:25,100 --> 00:15:28,100
is a concept of so-called MPE
那就是所谓的 MPE，

248
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:31,100
or maximum permissible exposure.
即最大允许照射量。

249
00:15:32,100 --> 00:15:36,100
So maximum permissible exposure
最大允许照射量

250
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:41,100
represents a threshold that you are going to establish
代表一个阈值，你要为

251
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:44,100
for every type and class of a laser
每种类型和等级的激光确定这个阈值，

252
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:49,100
that would enable you to quantify
它能让你量化判断

253
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:52,100
whether you are operating in a safe environment
你是在安全的环境中操作，

254
00:15:52,100 --> 00:15:55,100
or you don't operate in a safe environment.
还是不在安全的环境中操作。

255
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:58,100
So every laser has a certain output characteristics
每台激光器都有一定的输出特性，

256
00:15:58,100 --> 00:16:00,100
such as wavelength, output, energy and power.
比如波长、输出、能量和功率，

257
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:02,100
The size of the irradiated area
被照射区域的大小，

258
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,100
and also the duration of the exposure.
以及照射的持续时间。

259
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:06,100
And all these different output characteristics
所有这些不同的输出特性

260
00:16:06,100 --> 00:16:09,100
are going to define how much exposure
将决定多大的激光照射

261
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:11,100
to laser is hazardous
是有危害的，

262
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:14,100
and that exposure is going to be quantified
而这种照射将被量化为

263
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:17,100
to the so-called maximum permissible exposure.
所谓的最大允许照射量。

264
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:20,100
So the maximum permissible exposure
所以最大允许照射量

265
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:25,100
is a quantity that gives you the information
这个量给你提供的信息

266
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:27,100
about the greatest exposure
是最大照射量，

267
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:30,100
that most individuals can tolerate
即大多数人能够承受

268
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:32,100
without sustaining injury.
而不会受伤的照射量。

269
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:35,100
So if you are dealing with a specific type of a laser
所以如果你要使用某种特定的激光器，

270
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:37,100
you would have to analyze
你就必须分析

271
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:39,100
and figure out based on the wavelength
并根据波长、

272
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,100
and the power levels
功率水平

273
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:43,100
and also exposure time
以及照射时间来弄清楚，

274
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:46,100
would have to determine from certain specific tables
要从某些专门的表格中查出，

275
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:48,100
you have to determine the MPE
你必须确定

276
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,100
for that specific laser.
这台激光器的 MPE。

277
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:53,100
And if you are operating that laser
如果你要操作这台激光器，

278
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:55,100
you want to make sure that
你要确保

279
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:58,100
the amount of irradiance that goes into your eye
进入你眼睛的辐照度

280
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:00,100
is below this threshold
低于这个阈值，

281
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:04,100
below this so-called maximum permissible exposure.
低于这个所谓的最大允许照射量。

282
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:07,100
If the amount of power that's coming out of the laser
如果激光器输出的功率

283
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:10,100
is higher, is above the MPE
更高，高于 MPE，

284
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:13,100
then you would have to introduce
那你就必须采取

285
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:15,100
certain laser safety measures
某些激光安全措施，

286
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:19,100
to push the MPE, to push the power of the laser
把 MPE，把激光的功率，

287
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:21,100
or the power that goes into your eye
或者说进入你眼睛的功率，

288
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:24,100
below this threshold.
降到这个阈值以下。

289
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:26,100
It turns out that MPE
事实证明，MPE，

290
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:28,100
or maximum permissible exposure
也就是最大允许照射量，

291
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:30,100
is going to depend on both
同时取决于

292
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:32,100
both on incident irradiance level
入射辐照度水平，

293
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:34,100
coming out of the laser
也就是激光器输出的，

294
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:36,100
and also exposure time.
以及照射时间。

295
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:39,100
In other words you may have
换句话说，

296
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:41,100
the same level of risk
你可能会面临同样程度的风险，

297
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:44,100
if you are handling low power laser
如果你使用低功率激光器，

298
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:46,100
over a longer period of time
时间较长，

299
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:49,100
as you would with a high power laser
就和使用高功率激光器、

300
00:17:49,100 --> 00:17:51,100
over a shorter period of time.
时间较短的情况一样。

301
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:52,100
So you have to take into account
所以你必须同时考虑

302
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:57,100
both the incident irradiance level of a laser
激光的入射辐照度水平

303
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:59,100
and then also exposure time.
和照射时间。

304
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:01,100
The MPE is usually expressed
MPE 通常以

305
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:03,100
in terms of allowable exposure time in seconds
给定辐照度下的允许照射时间（秒）

306
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:05,100
for a given irradiance.
来表示。

307
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:07,100
So the unit that we are going to use
我们通常使用的单位

308
00:18:07,100 --> 00:18:09,100
is usually watts per centimeter squared
是瓦每平方厘米，

309
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:10,100
at a particular wavelength.
针对某一特定波长。

310
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:12,100
So when you are calculating the irradiance
所以当你计算

311
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:17,100
of a laser that you are going to operate
你要操作的激光器的辐照度时，

312
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:19,100
you would want to figure out the irradiance
你要算出

313
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:20,100
in terms of this unit,
以这个单位，

314
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:22,100
watt per centimeter squared
也就是瓦每平方厘米表示的辐照度，

315
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:24,100
because that is what you are going to be comparing to.
因为你要拿它来比较。

316
